  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.673919692307692,
      "narration_en": "Same car, same wall. One at thirty miles an hour, one at forty.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "141c6b67d005dc8d3769cbb1396299044c31853201e0e5e2b9f7368fc05e416e"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.673919692307692,
      "end": 6.815215384615385,
      "narration_en": "Only ten faster, but look how much deeper the front crushes.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d76b1eee90c40fa9826cfe2ff8790ce5a27b563dcecef36be58e8ada490c1673"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.815215384615385,
      "end": 9.391302076923077,
      "narration_en": "Crash energy grows with the square of your speed.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ae51e490688b8f525bbf06e2469895cc4db00a7932a7b75d258e8523e106dfa7"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.391302076923077,
      "end": 12.78263876923077,
      "narration_en": "So ten more miles an hour means seventy-eight percent more energy.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ad77f19bb51688817e036e21620770aab9d1cf7d6d5b24e8f01f24ba0ef8b470"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.78263876923077,
      "end": 14.478308461538463,
      "narration_en": "And every bit of it has to go somewhere.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3f4bb936a44be173c411409ed79b01a429e6be3a7d5f8cd5ef9a89381deecd50"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.478308461538463,
      "end": 18.695686153846154,
      "narration_en": "These steel rails fold like an accordion and turn it into bent metal and heat.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f1987c51e60b4e2f87031ccc454156191573151f60edac3f1ac81d3cc34ba19f"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.695686153846154,
      "end": 20.923938846153845,
      "narration_en": "At thirty, they crush about twenty inches.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "90cd7e6cbcb1fdfaec293efcb3b0f371ed21859f7616f023f19b3805b4a327bc"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.923938846153845,
      "end": 24.152192538461538,
      "narration_en": "At forty, nearly twenty-eight. Almost all the way to the cabin.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e516d14918a87e00b89bb0a7fd765b4f8b9869d4b6422e7d67d4da38c6f79115"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.152192538461538,
      "end": 27.51086223076923,
      "narration_en": "Hitting a wall at thirty is like falling off a three-story building.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7f098d8595e0d14b189cfa8871e82c07df8de93d378ed7bb6148754ffbb9bd8f"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.51086223076923,
      "end": 29.510865923076924,
      "narration_en": "At forty, it's a five-story fall.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b90a2ed8c906cb00ceccc59a04b61bad0160bed45a38f097157471f89cadea83"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.510865923076924,
      "end": 34.04349361538462,
      "narration_en": "Even with braking: where the slower car stops, the faster one is still doing thirty-five.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d6fbbefe142c6ad3b3ede4aadfaa89ed879d844b8ff0f25f0a361fc9bd62087a"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.04349361538462,
      "end": 37.82608030769231,
      "narration_en": "Same driver, same brakes. Ten miles an hour is the whole difference.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5755ea0ff8aaa7fa46343a7c222ba315d8d00fafa6b521cc06567f372bbf7fdb"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.82608030769231,
      "end": 42.0,
      "narration_en": "So in town, those ten aren't a little faster. They're almost twice the crash.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "aa57d327f0605da9010c99b5915009cc38e294f0c6b576b52e846f8fccc1b7cf"
    }
  ],
